1. Sort
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Home as HomeFragment
    participant BS as FilterSortBottomSheet
    participant VM as TaskViewModel
    participant TLF as TaskListFragment
    participant DB as DB (SQLite)
    participant Adapter as TaskAdapter

    User->>Home: Click btnSort
    Home->>BS: new FilterSortBottomSheet(...)
    User->>BS: Chọn tiêu chí & nhấn btnApply
    BS->>Home: onApply(sortColumn, isAscending)
    Home->>VM: setSortOrder(sortOrderString)
    VM->>VM: sortOrder.setValue(value)
    Note right of VM: LiveData phát thông báo
    VM-->>TLF: onChanged(sortOrder) [via observe]
    TLF->>TLF: loadTasks()
    TLF->>DB: getTasksSortedFiltered(...)
    DB-->>TLF: return List<Task>
    TLF->>Adapter: updateData(tasks)
    Adapter->>Adapter: notifyDataSetChanged()
    Adapter-->>User: Cập nhật giao diện RecyclerView
-------------------------------------------------------
2. Search
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Home as HomeFragment
    participant VM as TaskViewModel
    participant TLF as TaskListFragment
    participant Database as DB (SQLite)
    participant Adapter as TaskAdapter

    User->>Home: Nhập ký tự vào etSearch
    Home->>Home: onTextChanged(s)
    Home->>VM: setSearchQuery(query)
    VM->>VM: searchQuery.setValue(query)
    Note right of VM: LiveData thông báo tới các Fragment con
    VM-->>TLF: onChanged(query) [via observe]
    TLF->>TLF: loadTasks()
    TLF->>Database: getTasksSortedFiltered(..., query)
    Database-->>TLF: return List<Task> (Filtered)
    TLF->>Adapter: updateData(tasks)
    Adapter->>Adapter: notifyDataSetChanged()
    Adapter-->>User: Hiển thị danh sách kết quả tìm kiếm
-------------------------------------------------------
3. Add task
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant AddFrag as AddTaskFragment
    participant Picker as Date/TimePickerDialog
    participant Database as DB (SQLite)
    participant NotiManager as DeadlineNotificationManager
    participant Nav as NavController

    User->>AddFrag: Nhập thông tin (Title, Content...)
    User->>AddFrag: Click btnDeadline
    AddFrag->>Picker: showDateTimePicker()
    Picker-->>AddFrag: Trả về thời gian (Calendar)
    User->>AddFrag: Click btnSave
    AddFrag->>AddFrag: saveTask()

    create participant NewTask as Task Object
    AddFrag->>NewTask: new Task(data)

    AddFrag->>Database: addTask(newTask)
    Database-->>AddFrag: return taskId

    alt Notify Enabled & Deadline set
        AddFrag->>NotiManager: scheduleDeadlineNotification(context, newTask)
        NotiManager->>NotiManager: Set Alarm via AlarmManager
    end

    AddFrag->>AddFrag: Toast "Task đã thêm!"
    AddFrag->>Nav: navigateUp()
    Nav-->>User: Quay lại màn hình danh sách (Home)